  "summary": "Currently I work as a Custom Software Engineer at Accenture LLP in the Health and Public Services sector. I have three years of experience in developing and maintaining client applications. In those three years I have used a variety of technologies such as Oracle DB, SAP Callidus, Microsoft Power Platform, JavaScript, HTML, and CSS. I also have experience using C++, Java, Python, SQL, R, and other various coding languages and frameworks in my side projects.\n\nWhile my technical background leads my career I also enjoy being active in my community. I work part time as a performer for a non-profit organization called El Ballet Folklorico Estudiantil y Mariachi (EBFE) based out of Flint, Michigan. EBFE promotes and preserves Mexican culture through music, art, and dance. I find that working at Accenture and EBFE helps me strike a healthy balance of work, life, and community service; allowing me to be a well rounded individual.",
